  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Shang Yan Fei keeps the righteous path army supplied, the clan leaders of Southern Border super forces including Yi clan, Luo clan, Yao clan, and Xia clan join the seventh wave of fighting.",
      "chapters": [
        966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-in-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_yan_fei",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "fac_yi_clan",
        "fac_luo_clan",
        "fac_yao_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wu Yong works out that Xia clan is undoubtedly the mysterious force that earlier saved Immortal Yan Huang from assassination. Xia clan’s wisdom path Gu Immortal Xia Qing Cang, famous in Southern Border, accompanies Yan Huang to the Moon Bowl challenge and stands guard for him through the fight. Wu Yi Hai concedes the battle and Moon Bowl to end it, and Xia Qing Cang holds Yan Huang back from pursuing because the clan’s objective is already met.",
      "chapters": [
        1303
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-unknown-force-behind-yan-huang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_yan_huang",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_moon_bowl",
        "char_wu_yi_hai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia clan is special in Southern Border, and even among the five regions, because this super force mainly cultivates light path and wisdom path. Wisdom path Gu Immortals are rare, yet Xia clan has five of them, some of them strong experts, and among Southern Border’s wisdom path Gu Immortals Xia clan is the domineering force. Xia Liu Pei is a wisdom path Gu Immortal famous as a deduction expert. After Immortal Yan Huang defeats Wu Yu Bo, Xia clan deliberately spreads the fight, which the meticulous Xia Qing Cang had recorded with information path Immortal Gu while guarding him. Wu clan loses Moon Bowl, and Xia clan uses righteous path rules so Wu does not object.",
      "chapters": [
        1304
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recorded-fight",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_wisdom",
        "char_wu_yu_bo",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_wu_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia clan emerges as the greatest beneficiary of Wu clan’s loss of Moon Bowl, and decides to keep plotting against Wu clan for further gains, this time targeting Frosty Peak.",
      "chapters": [
        1306
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "renewed-plotting-toward-frosty-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_frosty_peak"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia Zhuo Mo, a wisdom path Gu Immortal, and Xia Fei Kuai, a rank seven with great battle strength, meet Wu Yi Hai at Frosty Peak. They serve four seasons tea, created by Xia clan’s first supreme elder, a time path great expert: one sip tastes of spring, autumn, summer, and winter.",
      "chapters": [
        1307
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "frosty-peak-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xia_zhuo_mo",
        "char_xia_fei_kuai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia Fei Kuai agrees on his own authority, over Xia Zhuo Mo’s hesitation, that a five-year Frosty Peak status quo will be the stake if Wu Yi Hai wins their spar.",
      "chapters": [
        1309
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spar-stake-agreed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia Fei Kuai uses Thirty-three Heavenly Lights in the Frosty Peak spar. Wu Yi Hai pulls the tortoise-shell thoughts back into his mind, yet the killer move keeps going, flattens the mountain valley, and leaves him unhurt inside the tortoise shell. Xia Fei Kuai’s ten moves leave only slight marks on the shell, and he concedes the spar. Xia Fei Kuai leaves the field. Xia Zhuo Mo leaves after him, saying he will come back in five years.",
      "chapters": [
        1311
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "peak-spar",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_thirty_three_heavenly_lights"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Xia clan had long wanted Qiao clan’s empty origin pit for its space path resources but held off while Wu clan backed Qiao clan, and it annexes the pit once Qiao Zhi Cai and Wu Yong are both missing.",
      "chapters": [
        1346
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "empty-origin-pit-annexation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_qiao_clan",
        "char_qiao_zhi_cai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the intersection of red dragon river and jade dragon river, Xia clan sits east of the whirlpool, with Chai clan’s Human Smoke Mountain to the north and Ba clan to the south.",
      "chapters": [
        1347
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "river-junction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_chai_clan",
        "loc_human_smoke_mountain",
        "fac_ba_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border’s righteous path has thirteen super clans, and Xia clan is named in that list with Wu, Ba, Shang, Tie, Hou, Luo, Qiao, Chai, Yi, Chi, Yang, and Yao.",
      "chapters": [
        1610
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "super-clan-list",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
